{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"3005025010010","name":"摩美々","text":"……何着ようかなぁ","trans":"……穿什么好呢","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010020","name":"摩美々","text":"……え\r\n気温、高ぁ……","trans":"……诶\n气温，好高……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010040","name":"摩美々","text":"……あ、期間限定","trans":"……啊，期间限定","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010050","name":"摩美々","text":"……ジェラート屋さん","trans":"……冰淇淋店","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010060","name":"摩美々","text":"駅から\r\n徒歩、５分……","trans":"从车站\n步行，5分钟……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010070","name":"摩美々","text":"……歩かなくてもいいなら\r\n行くんだケドー","trans":"……要是不用走路的话\n我是会去的啦——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010080","name":"摩美々","text":"霧子じゃーん","trans":"这不是雾子嘛——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010090","name":"霧子","text":"摩美々ちゃん……\r\nお疲れさま……","trans":"摩美美……\n辛苦了……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010110","name":"霧子","text":"書類……？","trans":"文件……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010120","name":"摩美々","text":"そうだねー\r\n霧子もー？","trans":"是啊——\n雾子也是——？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010130","name":"霧子","text":"うん……\r\n今……終わって……","trans":"嗯……\n刚刚……结束了……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010140","name":"摩美々","text":"じゃー、どこか寄って帰るー？\r\n何か食べたりとかぁ","trans":"那——要不要顺路去哪逛逛再回去——？\n比如吃点东西什么的","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010150","name":"霧子","text":"……\r\n冷たいの……どうかな……","trans":"……\n凉的……怎么样……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010160","name":"摩美々","text":"……冷たいの","trans":"……凉的","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010170","name":"摩美々","text":"電車で移動してもいいなら、あるかもー","trans":"能坐电车过去的话，也许有哦——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010180","name":"霧子","text":"うん……いいよ……","trans":"嗯……好啊……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010190","name":"摩美々","text":"あと、駅からちょっと歩くケド、いいー？","trans":"还有，从车站要走一小段，可以吗——？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010220","name":"霧子","text":"……摩美々ちゃん……？","trans":"……摩美美……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010230","name":"摩美々","text":"……大丈夫だケド","trans":"……不过没问题啦","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010240","name":"摩美々","text":"……全然、５分じゃない","trans":"……完全，不止5分钟","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010260","name":"霧子","text":"あ……あれ……","trans":"啊……咦……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010270","name":"摩美々","text":"んー？\r\nあれ、って──","trans":"嗯——？\n你说咦，是指——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010280","name":"摩美々","text":"……シャワー？","trans":"……淋浴？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010290","name":"摩美々","text":"すずしー……","trans":"好凉快——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010300","name":"霧子","text":"ひんやり……だね……","trans":"冰凉凉的……呢……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010310","name":"摩美々","text":"これ、びしょびしょにならないのー？","trans":"这个，不会弄得湿透吗——？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010320","name":"霧子","text":"ふふ……\r\nなっちゃう……かも……","trans":"呵呵……\n也许会……湿掉……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010340","name":"摩美々","text":"ま、なってもいいケドー","trans":"嘛，湿了也没关系啦——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010350","name":"摩美々","text":"この暑さなら\r\nどうせ、すぐ乾くだろうしー","trans":"这么热的天\n反正马上就会干吧——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010360","name":"霧子","text":"あ……","trans":"啊……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010370","name":"霧子","text":"摩美々ちゃん……\r\nあのお店……","trans":"摩美美……\n那家店……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010380","name":"摩美々","text":"あ、そのお店ー","trans":"啊，那家店——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010390","name":"摩美々","text":"近くにあったんだぁ","trans":"原来就在附近啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010400","name":"霧子","text":"入る……？","trans":"要进去吗……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010410","name":"摩美々","text":"んー……\r\nもうちょっと、涼んでからぁ","trans":"嗯——……\n再凉快一会儿吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010420","name":"霧子","text":"ふふ……そうだね……","trans":"呵呵……是啊……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010430","name":"摩美々","text":"……ジェラート、うまぁ","trans":"……冰淇淋，好吃啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010440","name":"霧子","text":"甘くて……ひんやり……","trans":"又甜……又冰凉……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010450","name":"霧子","text":"がんばって……よかったね……","trans":"努力走过来……太好了……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010460","name":"摩美々","text":"そうかもねー","trans":"也许吧——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010470","name":"摩美々","text":"まぁ、徒歩５分ではなかったケドー","trans":"嘛，不过确实不是步行5分钟啦——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010480","name":"霧子","text":"ひと口……\r\nどうかな……？","trans":"一口……\n怎么样……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010490","name":"摩美々","text":"じゃー、交換ー","trans":"那就，交换——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010500","name":"霧子","text":"おいしいね……","trans":"很好吃呢……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010520","name":"摩美々","text":"お土産に買って帰れたらよかったのにー","trans":"要是能买回去当伴手礼就好了——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010530","name":"霧子","text":"外が……ジェラートくらい……\r\nひんやりだったら……","trans":"要是外面……有冰淇淋那么……\n冰凉的话……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025010540","name":"摩美々","text":"それ、冬ー","trans":"那不就是冬天——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}